AB  - In this paper introduces an innovative Integrated Alcohol Detection System (IADS) designed to enhance road safety. The system seamlessly integrates a robust alcohol detection engine with a vehicle's ignition system, automatically locking the engine upon detecting alcohol levels exceeding legal limits. In addition to engine locking, the IADS features an SMS notification system that promptly alerts pre-defined contacts when a violation is detected. This ensures timely communication to concerned parties, allowing for appropriate intervention or assistance. The proposed system utilizes advanced sensor technologies for precise alcohol level measurement, paired with a reliable microcontroller for real-time processing.
