AB  - Every day, a large number of people die in road accidents around the world. The use of a smart helmet band is an effective solution to the problem. The smart helmet band is an innovative concept that makes motorcycle riding safer than ever before. By utilizing GPS technology, the smart helmet band can assist in the event of an accident. There are basically 3 sections into which the system is spilt, a helmet circuit, a mobile application and car circuits. The helmet circuit features an IR and alcohol detection sensor at first. Road accidents are fast increasing in developing countries like India, as transportation technology advances and the total number of cars increases. This technological innovation also exacerbated traffic hazards. Two-wheelers are responsible for 25% of all traffic fatalities. As a result, traffic accidents become more common, resulting in severe loss of life due to insufficient emergency assistance. If these two conditions are not met, the Smart Helmet part of the preventative prevents the relay from turning on the engine. The microprocessor controls the function of the relay, and as a result, the ignition.
